    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, i thought originalists were the ones who argued for the individual right? i think the Heller case used an originalist method to reach that conclusion. can you go deeper into the actual legal reasoning used by both sides? i need to see the actual mechanics of how they interpret the text differently so i can explain it in my paper.",
